&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;sc-gEkIjz cjtSrT MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 sc-hoLEA&quot;&gt;Raisin is the world’s leading platform for savings and investment products. Founded in 2012, the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;FinTech&lt;/strong&gt; connects consumers with banks in the EU, the UK and the US. This gives consumers &lt;strong&gt;better interest rates&lt;/strong&gt; and banks a &lt;strong&gt;diversified form of refinancing&lt;/strong&gt;. Our vision is to offer savings and investments without barriers and thus open up the global 160 trillion euro market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;sc-gEkIjz cjtSrT MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 sc-hoLEA&quot;&gt;Raisin currently employs more than 800 people from over 75 countries worldwide. Today, the platform holds over 80 billion euros in assets from&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;more than one million investors&lt;/strong&gt; which have accrued over 5 billion euros in returns.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;135&quot; data-end=&quot;472&quot;&gt;The Custody &amp;amp; Principal Broking team serves as the backbone of Raisin Bank’s Digital Wealth Management (DWM) division, providing the secure, scalable foundation essential for retail investing. We manage the complex infrastructure, from securities trading mechanics to outsourcing oversight that ensures operational resilience and regulatory compliance. As our retail customer base grows, we are focused on continuous process optimization and high-volume scalability, ensuring our platforms remain reliable, secure, and fully compliant with BaFin standards. We are currently seeking a Senior Operations Manager to join this mission.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Process Optimization: &lt;/strong&gt;You will drive the evolution of operational workflows to ensure they are scalable and resilient, directly supporting high-volume retail growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Controls &amp;amp; Oversight:&lt;/strong&gt; You will define and execute the control framework for daily securities processing, ensuring rigorous validation of all outsourced clearing and settlement activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Regulatory Compliance:&lt;/strong&gt; You will partner with Compliance, Legal, and Risk teams to navigate the regulatory landscape and maintain strict adherence to German financial regulations (including KWG, WpHG, and MaRisk).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Resilience:&lt;/strong&gt; You will proactively investigate, moderate, and resolve complex securities discrepancies and trade breaks in close collaboration with cross-functional internal and external stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Due Diligence &amp;amp; Auditing:&lt;/strong&gt; You will actively support due diligence activities and comprehensive audits for both current and prospective outsourcing partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Project Contribution:&lt;/strong&gt; You will provide subject matter expertise for internal and external strategic initiatives, including product launches, platform upgrades, and system migrations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in Finance, Economics, Business Administration, or a completed banking apprenticeship (Bankkaufmann/-frau) with relevant further qualifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 7+ years of operations experience within a custodian bank (Depotbank), clearing firm, or retail broker in the German/European market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Private Customer Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Direct experience with mass-affluent and high-volume retail accounts, managing the complexities of fractional shares, and savings plans (Sparpläne).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical &amp;amp; Market Knowledge:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep understanding of Clearstream Banking Frankfurt (CBF), T2S, and European post-trade infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Risk &amp;amp; Controls:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven background in establishing and executing internal controls, particularly within the context of MaRisk and outsourced operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Business fluency in both &lt;strong&gt;German and English&lt;/strong&gt; is required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join our mission, join our team – and grow with us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Raisin, we care about each other and it is one of our top priorities to foster an open and caring environment in which everyone feels welcome and comfortable. Our culture is strongly driven by our ambitious team, which connects more than 75 different nationalities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of our team, you will benefit from:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Development Budget of €2,000 and four full training days per year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours, home office and 30 vacation days.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A company pension scheme (Betriebliche Altersvorsorge), which we support with 20%.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy more than 50+ different sports with Urban Sports Club: We subsidize your membership with more than €20 per month.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Do you miss being in the office? The Deutschland Ticket gets you there, which we subsidize with €25 per month.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Love cycling? With JobRad, lease the bike of your choice and enjoy tax savings, plus Raisin covers your monthly insurance costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hungry all the time? Snacks, daily fresh fruit as well as drinks provided at the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are moving from another country or city to join us? We may support your relocation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.raisin.com/corporate/raisin-applicant-privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Raisin Applicant Privacy Policy&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;728&quot; data-end=&quot;900&quot;&gt;We value diversity and the unique experiences each individual brings. If you’re excited about this role but don’t meet every requirement, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;907&quot; data-end=&quot;1013&quot;&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for everyone, regardless of race, colour, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, or gender identity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;SLSQ427149&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;my-2 [&amp;amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2&quot;&gt;Databricks operates at the leading edge of the unified data, analytics and AI space. Our customers turn to us to lead the accelerated innovation their businesses need to gain first‑mover advantage in today’s ultra‑competitive landscape.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;my-2 [&amp;amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2&quot;&gt;As we continue our rapid expansion across Central Europe, we are looking for a creative, execution‑oriented Strategic Account Executive to join the team in Germany and maximise the phenomenal market opportunity that exists for Databricks within the insurance vertical. Reporting to our Senior Director of Enterprise Sales, you will focus on building relationships and closing new business opportunities within one of Germany’s largest Reinsurers, based in Munich. You will be part of an account team supporting this highly strategic client. Leveraging your consultative sales experience in the Insurance/FSI vertical, you will help shape the data and AI strategy, identify and progress high-value opportunities, and deliver tangible business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;my-2 [&amp;amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2&quot;&gt;The impact you will have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;marker:text-quiet list-disc&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:my-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;my-2 [&amp;amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2&quot;&gt;You will take ownership of your flagship account, define a clear strategy, and relentlessly drive it to exceed revenue and consumption goals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:my-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;my-2 [&amp;amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2&quot;&gt;You will turn that strategy into action, executing with urgency and discipline to consistently overachieve your targets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:my-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;my-2 [&amp;amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2&quot;&gt;You will build boardroom‑level relationships, becoming the trusted advisor on all things data and AI for senior stakeholders up to and including C‑level.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:my-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;my-2 [&amp;amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2&quot;&gt;You will uncover and shape new business, expanding use cases and driving deeper platform consumption across your account.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:my-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;my-2 [&amp;amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2&quot;&gt;You will orchestrate the full Databricks ecosystem, mobilising internal teams to maximise impact and customer value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;py-0 my-0 prose-p:pt-0 prose-p:mb-2 prose-p:my-0 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:pt-0 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:mb-2 [&amp;amp;&gt;p]:my-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;my-2 [&amp;amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2&quot;&gt;You will demonstrate compelling value in every engagement, leading confident, insight‑led negotiations that take opportunities all the way to close.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;my-2 [&amp;amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2&quot;&gt;What we look for&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;439&quot; data-end=&quot;529&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;441&quot; data-end=&quot;529&quot;&gt;A proven record of exceeding revenue targets in complex enterprise sales environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;439&quot; data-end=&quot;529&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;441&quot; data-end=&quot;529&quot;&gt;Recognised insurance domain expertise, applied to expanding strategic Insurance/FSI accounts in Germany through deep understanding of regulatory, risk, and compliance dynamics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;711&quot; data-end=&quot;863&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;713&quot; data-end=&quot;863&quot;&gt;Proven success selling data, analytics, big data, AI, or other highly technical cloud software solutions through complex, multi-stakeholder, multi-year enterprise sales cycles&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to identify high-impact data and AI use cases and engage key buying centres to expand Databricks’ footprint and strategic relevance within an organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;864&quot; data-end=&quot;1012&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;866&quot; data-end=&quot;1012&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of consumption-based, land-and-expand models, with the ability to drive sustained growth within a single strategic account.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1013&quot; data-end=&quot;1129&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1015&quot; data-end=&quot;1129&quot;&gt;Demonstrated ability to create and shape demand, translating customer priorities into measurable business value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1130&quot; data-end=&quot;1317&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1132&quot; data-end=&quot;1317&quot;&gt;Disciplined use of sales methodologies such as MEDDPICC, account planning, Value Selling, or Command of the Message, combined with strong pipeline management and accurate forecasting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1318&quot; data-end=&quot;1470&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1320&quot; data-end=&quot;1470&quot;&gt;A track record of building executive-level champions and cross-functional account teams to execute against a defined account and territory strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1471&quot; data-end=&quot;1620&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1473&quot; data-end=&quot;1620&quot;&gt;Experience developing and executing partner strategies that extend reach, accelerate deal velocity, and support complex enterprise opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1621&quot; data-end=&quot;1792&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1623&quot; data-end=&quot;1792&quot;&gt;Willing and able to travel to customer sites, company and industry events - regionally and internationally&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1793&quot; data-end=&quot;1916&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1795&quot; data-end=&quot;1916&quot;&gt;Fluent in German and English, with the credibility to engage, challenge, and influence senior stakeholders up to C-level.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;my-2 [&amp;amp;+p]:mt-4 [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:inline-block [&amp;amp;_strong:has(+br)]:pb-2&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Databricks is the Data and AI company. More than 20,000 organizations worldwide — including adidas, AT&amp;amp;T, Bayer, Block, Mastercard, Rivian, Unilever, and 70% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data + AI Platform to build and scale data and AI apps, analytics and agents. Headquartered in San Francisco with 30+ offices around the globe, Databricks offers a unified platform that includes Genie, Lakebase, Agent Bricks, Lakeflow, Lakehouse, and Unity Catalog. To learn more, follow Databricks on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/databricks&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@Databricks&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/databricksinc/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;At Databricks, we strive to provide comprehensive benefits and perks that meet the needs of all of our employees. For specific details on the benefits offered in your region click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/154un3e8Xav4BceOSlcYFZRGEuQI54xMxVydRwQn54eQ/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive culture where everyone can excel. We take great care to ensure that our hiring practices are inclusive and meet equal employment opportunity standards. Individuals looking for employment at Databricks are considered without regard to age, color, disability, ethnicity, family or marital status, gender identity or expression, language, national origin, physical and mental ability, political affiliation, race, religion, sexual orientation, socio-economic status, veteran status, and other protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If access to export-controlled technology or source code is required for performance of job duties, it is within Employer&#39;s discretion whether to apply for a U.S. government license for such positions, and Employer may decline to proceed with an applicant on this basis alone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;SLSQ427R134&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Although a specific location may be posted, candidates can be based anywhere in Germany.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;model-response-message-contentr_20e8b41a5d5b4276&quot; class=&quot;markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;Databricks operates at the leading edge of the unified data, analytics, and AI space. Our customers turn to us to lead the accelerated innovation their businesses need to gain a first‑mover advantage in today’s ultra‑competitive landscape.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;As we continue our rapid expansion across Central Europe, we are looking for a creative, execution‑oriented &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;108&quot;&gt;Strategic Account Executive&lt;/strong&gt; to join the team in Germany and maximise the phenomenal market opportunity that exists for Databricks within the FSI vertical. Reporting to our Senior Director of Enterprise Sales, you will focus on building relationships and closing new business opportunities within Germany’s largest savings bank, and one of Europes largest Insurance groups with HQ in Hannover. You will be the Strategic Account lead, working with a dedicated account team supporting these highly key clients. Leveraging your consultative sales experience in the Banking/FSI vertical, you will help shape the data and AI strategy, identify and progress high-value opportunities, and deliver tangible business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
