&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are looking for&amp;nbsp;recent or soon to be graduates (2026-2027) from a range of&amp;nbsp;STEM&amp;nbsp;disciplines to begin building a career at InterSystems. We are&amp;nbsp;a global data management software company&amp;nbsp;operating&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;a number of&amp;nbsp;sectors, including healthcare,&amp;nbsp;legal&amp;nbsp;and financial services.&amp;nbsp;Based in&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Windsor&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;or&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Edinburgh&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;, our Technical Graduates will receive&amp;nbsp;personalised&amp;nbsp;mentorship while fulfilling a range of responsibilities&amp;nbsp;across&amp;nbsp;a&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;9 month&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; contract, starting in &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;spring or autumn 2027&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our graduate hiring has been growing consistently over the last few years, and there is a company-wide drive to increase this further and support the development of our early-career employees. If you have recently graduated or will be graduating in 2027 from a STEM discipline, we would welcome your application! The duration of our graduate contracts starts at 9 months, but where possible, our hope is to try and move people into permanent positions, allowing you to continue using and developing the knowledge and skills that you have gained throughout the initial period.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;If your application is successful in our early stages, you may be selected by one of our technical teams to be considered for their more specific graduate role – we will provide further details about those positions in due course. Our programme is non-rotational – you will remain with one team for the duration of the contract. However, you&#39;ll still get great exposure to other areas of the business.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
